# Start your engines! is an ability of the permanent (CR 702.179a, 704.5aa): one that has lost all its abilities has none to
# give. Bot1's Perilous Snare gives Bot1 speed 1 on turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2's Oko, Thief of Crowns makes the Snare an Elk
# that has lost all abilities (CR 613.1f), and on turn 4 Oko exchanges Bot2's Mox Sapphire for it. Bot2, with no speed,
# now controls the Snare and gets none; Bot1 keeps speed 1. The positive control is
# speed-is-gained-with-control-of-a-snare-and-max-speed-is-its-controllers, where a Snare that has kept its abilities
# gives the player who takes control of it speed.

